# Architecture: sddra Project

Purpose:
  Architecture decisions and documentation for sddra.ai.

Current Architecture:
  Type: Modular Monolith
  Pattern: Specification-Driven Development (SDD)
  Layers: Specification (.sdd/) + Runtime (sdd-adapter/)

Key Decisions:
  - .sdd/ is source of truth
  - Runtime implements specs, never contradicts
  - Human docs use append protocol for updates
  - Project instance at .sdd/projects/sddra/

